return {h=11,w=346,cr=30,hc=40,bh=140,gr="fast",eg={"fairy"},st={250,5,5,35,105,50},ab={{30,0},{32,0},{131,1}},genus={en="Egg Pokémon",es="Pokémon Huevo",pt="Pokémon Ovo"},flavor={en={[1]="A rare and elusive Pokémon that is said to bring happiness to those who manage to get it.",[2]="A rare and elusive Pokémon that is said to bring happiness to those who manage to get it.",[3]="A gentle and kindhearted Pokémon that shares its nutritious eggs if it sees an injured Pokémon.",[4]="It walks carefully to prevent its egg from breaking. However, it is extremely fast at running away.",[5]="Few in number and difficult to capture, it is said to bring happiness to the trainer who catches it.",[6]="People try to catch it for its extremely nutritious eggs, but it rarely can be found.",[7]="CHANSEY lays nutritionally excellent eggs on an everyday basis. The eggs are so delicious, they are easily and eagerly devoured by even those people who have lost their appetite.",[8]="CHANSEY lays nutritionally excellent eggs on an everyday basis. The eggs are so delicious, they are easily and eagerly devoured by even those people who have lost their appetite.",[9]="CHANSEY lay nutritionally excellent eggs every day. The eggs are so delicious, they are eagerly devoured by even those people who have lost their appetite.",[10]="It lays several eggs a day. The eggs are apparently rich in nutrients and extremely delicious.",[11]="A rare and elusive Pokémon that is said to bring happiness to those who manage to catch one.",[12]="It is said to deliver happiness. Being compassionate, it shares its eggs with injured people.",[13]="It lays several eggs a day and won’t share them with those who have evil in their hearts.",[14]="A kindly Pokémon that lays highly nutritious eggs and shares them with injured Pokémon or people.",[15]="It walks carefully to prevent its egg from breaking. However, it is extremely fast at running away.",[16]="Being few in number and difficult to capture, it is said to bring happiness to the Trainer who catches it.",[17]="A kindly Pokémon that lays highly nutritious eggs and shares them with injured Pokémon or people.",[18]="A kindly Pokémon that lays highly nutritious eggs and shares them with injured Pokémon or people.",[21]="A kindly Pokémon that lays highly nutritious eggs and shares them with injured Pokémon or people.",[22]="A kindly Pokémon that lays highly nutritious eggs and shares them with injured Pokémon or people.",[23]="It is said to deliver happiness. Being compassionate, it shares its eggs with injured people.",[24]="It lays several eggs a day. The eggs are apparently rich in nutrients and extremely delicious.",[25]="Chansey lays nutritionally excellent eggs on an everyday basis. The eggs are so delicious, they are easily and eagerly devoured by even those people who have lost their appetite.",[26]="Chansey lays nutritionally excellent eggs on an everyday basis. The eggs are so delicious, they are easily and eagerly devoured by even those people who have lost their appetite.",[27]="The eggs laid by Chansey are rich in nutrients and a favorite food of many Pokémon.",[28]="Not only are these Pokémon fast runners, they’re also few in number, so anyone who finds one must be lucky indeed.",[29]="It seems that other Pokémon’s efforts to take its delicious, nutritious egg away from it caused Chansey to get faster at fleeing.",[30]="Because the eggs on their bellies have been overharvested by people in the past, the Chansey population remains very small.",[31]="A gentle and kindhearted Pokémon that shares its nutritious eggs if it sees an injured Pokémon.",[32]="A gentle and kindhearted Pokémon that shares its nutritious eggs if it sees an injured Pokémon.",[33]="The egg Chansey carries is not only delicious but also packed with nutrition. It’s used as a high-class cooking ingredient.",[34]="This species was once very slow. To protect their eggs from other creatures, these Pokémon became able to flee quickly.",[39]="This purehearted Pokémon shares its eggs with the injured."},es={[23]="Se dice que reparte felicidad. Se caracteriza por su compasión y reparte sus huevos entre la gente herida.",[24]="Pone varios huevos al día. Según parece son muy nutritivos y están riquísimos.",[25]="Chansey pone a diario huevos con un valor nutritivo altísimo. Están tan ricos que hasta quien no tenga hambre se los comerá en un abrir y cerrar de ojos.",[26]="Chansey pone a diario huevos con un valor nutritivo altísimo. Están tan ricos que hasta quien no tenga hambre se los comerá en un abrir y cerrar de ojos.",[27]="Los huevos que pone Chansey tienen un valor nutritivo altísimo. Muchos Pokémon los consideran un manjar.",[28]="Es un Pokémon poco común que escapa rápidamente, por lo que quienes se topen con uno pueden considerarse afortunados.",[29]="Ha desarrollado gran velocidad para huir de los Pokémon que quieren robarle sus huevos, que son exquisitos y poseen un gran valor nutritivo.",[30]="Su número ha disminuido espectacularmente debido al constante hurto del que son objeto sus huevos.",[31]="Este amable Pokémon comparte sus nutritivos huevos con quien encuentre herido.",[32]="Este amable Pokémon comparte sus nutritivos huevos con quien encuentre herido.",[33]="Los huevos que pone Chansey tienen un valor nutritivo altísimo y un sabor exquisito. Se consideran un manjar.",[34]="Este Pokémon solía ser lento de reflejos, pero ha desarrollado una gran velocidad para evitar que le roben sus preciados huevos."},pt="Este Pokémon de coração puro divide seus ovos com quem está ferido."},evo={{s=440},{s=113,from=440,c={{t="level-up",held=110,time="day"}}},{s=242,from=113,c={{t="level-up",happy=160}}}},moves={[1]={1,1,1,3,24,47,30,45,38,107,44,111,48,113,54,38},[2]={1,1,1,39,12,3,24,47,30,45,38,107,44,111,48,113,54,38},[3]={1,1,5,45,9,39,13,135,17,3,23,107,29,47,35,121,41,111,49,113,57,38},[4]={1,1,5,45,9,39,13,135,17,3,23,107,29,47,35,121,41,111,49,113,57,38},[5]={1,1,1,45,5,39,9,287,13,135,17,3,23,107,29,47,35,121